# Chingis — environment. Copy to .env; .env is gitignored and never enters a fleet.
# PERSONAL PROJECTS ONLY. Nothing employer-adjacent enters any plane, ever. (Spec §7)
#
# NOTE: leave a variable OUT rather than setting it empty. Sourcing this file with empty
# assignments clobbers real credentials already in the environment.

# --- W1: Claude Code headless against ANTHROPIC (the second lab) ---
# No key here: credentials live in the macOS Keychain via Claude Code's own OAuth.
# NEVER set ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL / ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY globally.
# W1 and W2 run the same tool and differ ONLY by environment, so a leaked redirect turns
# W1 into a second W2 -- the same lab twice, reported as cross-fleet. Both the adapter and
# preflight fail loudly on this, but do not rely on that.
# CLAUDE_BIN=claude

# --- Codex fleet: retained for when its allowance returns (~2026-09-01) ---
# Credentials come from ~/.codex/auth.json, written by `codex login`.

# --- WR raw lane + W2: the Z.ai coding endpoint ---
ZAI_API_KEY=
ZAI_CODING_ENDPOINT=https://api.z.ai/api/coding/paas/v4
# W2 drives Claude Code headless against the Anthropic-compatible endpoint:
ZAI_ANTHROPIC_ENDPOINT=https://api.z.ai/api/anthropic

# --- W0 local fleet: MLX / LM Studio server ---
MLX_SERVER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080

# --- Operator gate. Required to commit under a protected path. (Plan §7 L0) ---
# Do NOT set this persistently. Export it inline, off-cycle, for one commit.
# CHINGIS_OPERATOR=1
